            "review_title": "Review at Daruma",
            "review_text": "caipirina\nColombo, Sri Lanka747 contributions\n0\nWaited looong, food was kinda boring and dissapointing\nFeb 2017 • Family\nWent in thanks to appetizing pictures on the menu and seemingly happy people inside, eating. Ordered 2 'simple' lunch sets, which took over 25 minutes to arrive. Food was overall underwhelming. My kimchi seafood ramen came with 3 unopened mussels. Now, there might be an ongoing discussion as to if it is safe to eat unopened mussels or if it is merely a myth that those are bad for you. But trying to open those just with chopsticks? Thanks chef, great thinking. I am aware that this is a food court place, but I had a much better experience at a Korean BBQ place just next door a while ago. While the restaurant tries to appear Japanese, it is very clearly Korean.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 26, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
